{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b65b1318d324f88d78e766ba7d2c3afd3098e46829857afcdf82ec582463c477",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7208b193f5db25f97454dfaadd7921692dab68442c711c7df381d4ff0767eff5",
      "text": "伊集院北斗的特别日子",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e6e29ab82c2ae262ff3810ee624307ba62e6ac178dd5e50dd2f069b6a44988f",
      "text": "冬马和翔太在准备为北斗庆祝生日。\n但生日当天是情人节，\n两人怀疑北斗是否有空。\n另一方面，北斗却称生日已有约，\n回绝了女性的约会邀请……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553f4806545f1e0530dccd771680034114e90b393ece89c8cd5d9e15dda6956b",
      "text": "制作人在吗？我想去把帮忙预订的\n蛋糕取回来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b8d8cb5f7629392bb9b7fcba850797757e6b79e0f23d517da5de6624e9e4892",
      "text": "制作人去工作了哦。\n喏，替你保管的蛋糕预约单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38b2426622aa4e870a955d825fefcdabaab2a5c1b898122c80bdac223ef539f0",
      "text": "哦，谢啦。\n已经出发了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b0a6bec53333bf49dda6351e7b67da5c4356b9fdfc5d98119da15e33a23e1c2",
      "text": "唉，制作人\n来不了，真遗憾呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66e83a345371d8f9b6a82e926cd1c414b877db593024050ad86d3ab91c2f0675",
      "text": "是啊。不过，我们要连制作人的那份一起，\n全力给北斗庆祝才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9169aafdb06a3e09fae4a7b5fb62d39daf3d91749816bb52b574978957b852c4",
      "text": "说的也是呢。\n让北斗君度过一个最棒的生日吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8d9ecac8700126c5ecb29a78c78a8c392ac71589f8108888c358d09b2d5b12d",
      "text": "多谢款待，冬马。\n听说你为了我还专门买了食谱书？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2246d72ec2841de32f58904a3536250870b0f6d778b9c3d0758bff469e98c356",
      "text": "算是吧。\n……然后呢，你最喜欢哪一道？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63f15a2731335866717875f69cb74bd3f1551dda8f141d76890b52c26beac06d",
      "text": "唔，全部吧。\n每道都很好吃，选不出唯一一个呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f20f394adb3e9e95c992fd93587b63bd1649e6d313add95478e2ce85583d4848",
      "text": "那样根本没有参考价值吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a6d757947ed23467423cfb9bd638b24fe4a5907399b3df28879d3b7a4c53854",
      "text": "不过嘛，劲头十足地做出来也算有意义了。\n下次再做给你吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26e521f22def260c4ad97bddd1d96d885a8e5ab42233b98b4bae456ae3041e1a",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。真期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6636f454b0e1dede1d5e220adc079f43cf861d3e2a6d343c86b7ecf0eea1fcb",
      "text": "北斗君！\n我送的礼物怎么样？吓了一跳吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:259630d18a2f6fa2b3763cc307beb63aeeeae3c75e20997eb51bce799a0f079f",
      "text": "是啊，真没想到会是\n那种东西……翔太总是能让我吃惊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:130ac6581289ed6282bc640187b42cdb88c11a6e69838e2b5b3c817cbc2874c2",
      "text": "毕竟是难得的生日嘛～\n怎么说也得让你大吃一惊吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8efc56d7f776cd76c389f7217c85fd1dd045e929163a36a03cb9f44db42325fd",
      "text": "既然这样，下次就轮到我们\n让翔太吃一惊了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_12:1_2_003_12_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:facd38ad7185ab8db369d6315260ca811550a72d79fcea1a912213190b240ecd",
      "text": "嘿嘿，这才对嘛。\n敬请期待～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
